                "# Corvane Motion Systems — S&OP Supply Health\n",
                "\n",
                "**The event** — Dayton's HX-220 gear housings go **negative in week 2** (week of Oct 12): a typhoon berth closure at the Port of Yantian rolled Nanhai's three containers (+25/+18/+18 days), on top of a ~46% surge in SG-400 servo demand. Peak **1,054 housings short**, **$2.04M** of servo revenue at risk.\n",
                "\n",
                "**What to see** — the projection line (amber) dives below safety stock while the *if-POs-on-time* line (navy) never does · $2.34M of revenue at risk concentrates in HX-220 @ Dayton · the exposures table shows which plans the app has booked · Nanhai's on-time delivery collapses in September."
